        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "...Let's stop here for today."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "Huh? But I can still..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Overdoing it will undo you! You only just finished recovering. We're all sturdy Kuranta, but no-one torments her body like do!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "Alright..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "\u2014Could you help me brainstorm about those Arts I mentioned, then, auntie?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "...Didn't we already go over this yesterday?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "I watched this tape of Leithanian Knights battling last night, and I think I could pull from some parts of it to\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Last night?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "Ah..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "So you were up late again! I've said before, you need to get your rest!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Looks like someone's back in good shape. Them two old cranks can rest easy now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "Oh! Marcin? Is something up?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Something? Eh... yeah, you might call this something."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "This is, um?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Sponsors who came knocking at your door. Thirteen, in all. And there's some pretty high ranked corps looking for you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "Whoaahh. Glorious Shield's the weapons manufacturer, right... so even companies like these are into keeping competition knights?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Oh, they're all Knightclub invitations. They put the numbers there to make you gasp. They're looking to make you a fine puppet, that's all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Maria! You wouldn't let these capitalists lead you by the nose, would you?! Remember your sister here can outbid these and then some, anyway!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "Wait... I'm not falling for anything! Just, auntie, you spending money on me like that makes me feel kind of bad..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Money, my high-heeled foot. If I want to spend it, I'll spend it. I didn't buy this land by agonizing about it, I'll have you know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "(Is that why the 'gardens' here are just 'fields' now...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107",
            "name2": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Hah hah hah... fair to you, I know you turned every last one of them down. Made a fine family out of nothing but your prize money and a few years of retirement. Hats off."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "That said, I'm only here to hand these papers over. Saves M\u0142ynar the hassle. Rest of it's up to you two alone. Think it over and if you're okay, come relax over at the bar sometime."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Well... what do you say? Maria?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "I've said before, but I don't want our family crest to become a corporate logo... and I know I can't stand toe-to-toe with the rest of them, either. Not as I am right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "...You're going to press on?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "Mm-hm. This isn't just about the money."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "When I think of 'Nearl,' the name my grandpa and my parents protected all their lives, I can't imagine it was all just for the numbers and lines of the stock exchange."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "So..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#5",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Maria... Alright, it sounds like I'll be throwing all of these away, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "If we're going to make the cut for the Major, we need to get a lot more points, fast\u2014that's the biggest hurdle we face, as independent knights without a Knightclub to hide in."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Remember Szewczyk? Poor man, taken for a ride by his own sponsor. And yet he built up the points to rival nearly an entire team, just on sprint races, and duels alone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Meanwhile, you had the Knightclubs all wrangling the rules for point transfers, arranging it so their trump cards didn't even need to fight the preselections..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Maria",
        "text": "So I'll have to get past all of those Knightclub teams, soon enough..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "That's right. That's why we're going to have to take some special measures... if we're not wasting a single qualifier, we only have so many options."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Zofia",
        "text": "Such as\u2014"
    },
